WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:02.109
CLINT BARTON
Kate. Let's give them hell.

00:00:03.689 --> 00:00:04.939
♪♪

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.209
JEREMY RENNER
It's been a wonderful way to discover

00:00:07.259 --> 00:00:10.022
a lot more of the
humanity of who Clint Barton is.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.753
HAILEE STEINFELD
He was wonderful in showing me the ropes

00:00:15.803 --> 00:00:18.239
and collaborating with
me in finding this

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.036
amazing dynamic between Clint and Kate.

00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:22.569
KATE BISHOP
You're Hawkeye!

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.209
CLINT BARTON
Who the hell are you?

00:00:24.797 --> 00:00:26.437
TRINH TRAN
Kate Bishop saw what Clint Barton

00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:27.825
can do as Hawkeye.

00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:30.501
That really inspired
her to be like him.

00:00:30.552 --> 00:00:31.633
♪♪

00:00:35.165 --> 00:00:36.613
KEVIN FEIGE
Seeing the comic page come to life

00:00:36.664 --> 00:00:39.766
on the screen is what has
excited me for the past 20 years.

00:00:40.826 --> 00:00:43.387
What is equally exciting
is the enthusiasm

00:00:43.499 --> 00:00:47.119
that the actors themselves
bring to evolving these characters.

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:49.302
FLORENCE PUGH
My relationship with Hailee is

00:00:49.352 --> 00:00:52.363
our little heartbeats
throughout our stories.

00:00:52.414 --> 00:00:53.405
KATE BISHOP
Stop making me like you.

00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:54.667
YELENA BELOVA
I'm sorry I can't help it.

00:00:54.964 --> 00:00:57.120
BRAD WINDERBAUM
It's amazing what happens when you let

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:59.460
actors like Jeremy Renner
really have the space

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.969
to explore their
character and their backstory.

00:01:02.635 --> 00:01:04.316
JEREMY RENNER
First two weeks of shooting this,

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:07.432
I've said more than I've
said in the entire MCU Universe.

00:01:08.545 --> 00:01:10.904
TRINH TRAN
There's so much great source material.

00:01:10.954 --> 00:01:13.004
 There's a lot more story to tell.

00:01:15.438 --> 00:01:17.640
♪♪

